# EXAMPLE ONLY. This filename does not activate GitHub code ownership.
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace EVERY placeholder with eligible
# human maintainer handles. Remove the second handle if not applicable.
# All-path ownership intentionally covers future contracts, tests, manifests,
# instructions and new modules without relying on a guessed code layout.
# Two handles on one line mean either may approve; both are not required.
# Enable required code-owner review in repository settings separately.
* @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER @REPLACE_WITH_SECOND_MAINTAINER

# Keep enforcement/instructions explicitly owned if narrower rules are added.
/AGENTS.md @REPLACE_WITH_MAINTAINER @REPLACE_WITH_SECOND_MAINTAINER
